   "shortDescription": "Liquidity facility rate",
   "midDescription": "Liquidity facility rate",
   "longDescription": "The liquidity facility rate is the interest rate for the lending that the Riksbank offers to the banks in the supplementary liquidity facility. This interest rate is currently 0.75 percentage points higher than the policy rate",
